    "introduction": "Samantha Joann Boscarino (born December 26, 1994  is an American actress from Ventura County, California.Her first notable role was in the film The Clique, produced by Tyra Banks. She also appeared on The Tyra Banks Show with Elizabeth McLaughlin, Ellen Marlow, Sophie Anna Everhard and Bridgit Mendler. Boscarino also has a recurring role in Good Luck Charlie as Skyler, reuniting with Mendler. Her other television credits are JONAS, True Jackson, VP, Parenthood, Wizards of Waverly Place and the film The Perfect Game.In 2011, she was cast as Molly Garfunkel for the Nickelodeon series How to Rock. The series premiered on February 4, 2012.",
